  "body": "Designed by Jessop Architects, this striking contemporary residence combines architectural pedigree with a comprehensive, high-quality refurbishment in an enviable Mission Bay location. Substantial, beautifully presented and ready to move in and enjoy, the home has been thoughtfully updated with significant work already completed, and is constructed in cedar weatherboard, corrugated iron, Titan Board and plaster, supported by a 15-year warranty.\r\n\r\nElevated, north-facing and filled with natural light, the home enjoys sweeping outlooks with a glimpse of the sea beyond. Spanning approximately 278sqm across three levels, the generous floorplan delivers excellent space, separation and flexibility for modern family living. At its heart, expansive open-plan living and dining connect effortlessly to a large entertainer’s deck, creating an exceptional indoor-outdoor setting, while a separate lounge with a cosy gas fireplace and floor-to-ceiling glazing completes the main living level.\r\n\r\nThe beautifully appointed new kitchen features engineered stone benchtops, quality Bosch appliances, a new fridge/freezer and Vintec wine fridge. Four well-proportioned bedrooms enjoy excellent separation, complemented by three and a half newly completed bathrooms, including two ensuites and a separate powder room. Engineered oak flooring and a bespoke staircase with solid oak treads add warmth and architectural detail throughout, while internal-access double garaging completes the home.\r\n\r\nThe home has undergone an extensive refurbishment inside and out, with significant upgrades including:\r\n\r\n• Brand-new Torch-on Membrane roof by NZ Waterproofing Specialists Limited\r\n• 20-year roofing warranty + 5-year workmanship warranty\r\n• Both upper-level decks re-waterproofed with 20-year warranty + 5-year workmanship warranty\r\n• New EIFS plaster system with 15-year warranty + 5-year workmanship warranty\r\n• Resene X-200 exterior paint system with 10-year warranty\r\n• 15mm Engineered Oak Flooring. With bespoke custom made staircase. \r\n• Brand new carpet throughout. \r\n• New TigerTurf over the upper decks, creating a unique lawn-like outdoor space\r\n• New glass balustrading on top decks. \r\n• New glass panels and Stairworx detailing to the stairwell. \r\n• 3.5 brand new bathrooms, including two ensuites.\r\n• Heating - Gas Fire place & 2 x heat pumps. \r\n• Appliances - Bosch Gas Oven, Bosch Dishwasher, Vintec Wine Fridge, Samsung Fridge, Alpine Spa Pool. \r\n\r\nThe result is a beautifully resolved home where considered architectural design, contemporary finishes and substantial recent investment come together to create an exceptional, move-in-ready residence. Positioned in one of Auckland’s most sought-after eastern bays locations, Mission Bay Beach, Kohimarama and the waterfront are all just moments away, with Eastridge Shopping Centre close by for cafés, restaurants, shopping and everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nThe vendors have relocated south and are committed to a sale.",
